{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/extras/0696213ef5d01d90594f5bb70f3b4932.avif?t=1768660741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/extras_big/0696213ef5d01d90594f5bb70f3b4932.avif?t=1768660741 width=800 height=388 /></span><i>Fallen Hunter</i> is a dark fantasy action-RPG where you step into the shattered world of  war. Fight with two unique playable characters\u2014each with their own story, combat style, and moral path\u2014as you fight to uncover the truth behind a corrupted order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield blades  to stand against monstrous creatures and lost souls. Explore forgotten ruins, devastated lands, and ancient temples in a narrative-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise third-person combat, challenging enemies, and a haunting, lore-rich world, <i>Fallen Hunter</i> invites you to defy judgment\u2014and reclaim your destiny.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Soul Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679520/82cce332f84b726a97acb25e7968865d957b6616.jpg"},{"name":"You Defeated Astrae","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679520/82cce332f84b726a97acb25e7968865d957b6616.jpg"},{"name":"You Defeated The Bounty Hunters Duo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679520/82cce332f84b726a97acb25e7968865d957b6616.jpg"},{"name":"You Defeated Helia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679520/82cce332f84b726a97acb25e7968865d957b6616.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679520?t=1768660741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679520/21387069ab1d0e0f4840